summary: MLS Enforcing-Mode Boot Validation (minimal)
description: |
    Switches a Fedora guest from the default targeted SELinux policy to
    mls and validates a working, SELinux-enforcing boot with cloud-init
    and networking functional. This is the minimal, production version
    of the fix set developed in tmt/mls.fmf (same directory); see that
    file's git history for the full investigation behind these fixes.

prepare:
  - name: Install MLS policy, build/load policy fixes, switch to MLS and then Enforcing (2 reboots)
    how: shell
    script: $TMT_TREE/tmt/mls-final-prepare.sh

execute:
  how: tmt
  script: $TMT_TREE/tmt/mls-final-execute.sh
